 "description": "[PAID] The complete record between two teams, and every match they have ever played.\n\nAnswers \"who wins more between these two, and how often do they draw?\" \u2014 matches\nplayed, wins each way, draws, goals each way and the draw percentage, all from team A's\nperspective, followed by every meeting with its date, competition and score. Optionally\nnarrow to one competition type or a single edition to compare only their league games,\nor only one season.\n\nBoth teams are given as numeric ids, which list_teams returns.\n\nCosts 1 point per call (1 point = 1 cent); paginated calls cost 1 point per page.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "a": {
    "description": "Team A, as a numeric id from list_teams. The record is reported from this team's point of view.",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "b": {
    "description": "Team B, as a numeric id from list_teams. Must differ from a.",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "item": {
    "description": "Restrict to a single edition or season id, from list_tournaments with a `tournament` argument.",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "type": {
    "description": "Restrict to one competition type, such as league or cup.",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "a",
   "b"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
